# Supplier catalogue exports.
#
# Bulk third-party product data, images and a SQLite database — several hundred
# megabytes at full scale, and not this repository's to redistribute. The
# importer finds the bundle by name at the repository root; keep it there and
# out of version control. `apps/api/scripts/importArogga.ts` documents the shape.
#
# Both spellings are listed on purpose. The bundle arrives named either way
# depending on whether it came out of the zip or off a filesystem that dislikes
# spaces, and for a while only the spaced form was here — so twelve gigabytes of
# third-party product data sat untracked but *unignored*, one `git add -A` away
# from the history. Matching the name is not worth being clever about.
arogga export/
arogga_export/
